oring this task","timestamp":"2025-08-22T20:08:57","avatar":""},{"id":"comment-9-0-1-1","author":"Alyssa Marie Donayre","text":"thanks for the tutorial @Janin Canonero","timestamp":"2025-08-22T20:15:35","avatar":""},{"id":"comment-9-0-1-2","author":"Khedive Adana","text":"@Janin Canonero Done watching the video. Thank you for the tutorial.","timestamp":"2025-08-22T23:57:42","avatar":""},{"id":"comment-9-0-1-3","author":"Alyssa Marie Donayre","text":"Done watching the video. Thank you, @Janin Canonero , for teaching us the proper way to conduct QA of meta titles and descriptions.","timestamp":"2025-08-26T10:03:50","avatar":""},{"id":"comment-9-0-1-4","author":"Marie Angela","text":"I’ve finished watching the video. Thank you @Janin Canonero , for clearly explaining the correct approach to creating and conducting QA for meta titles and descriptions.","timestamp":"2025-08-26T11:18:42","avatar":""},{"id":"comment-9-0-1-5","author":"Alyssa Marie Donayre","text":"@farhan nazardin please watch this video tutorial, and update here once done.","timestamp":"2025-09-24T17:24:29","avatar":""},{"id":"comment-9-0-1-6","author":"farhan nazardin","text":"Done :)","timestamp":"2025-09-24T21:25:24","avatar":""},{"id":"comment-9-0-1-7","author":"Alyssa Marie Donayre","text":"thanks far!","timestamp":"2025-09-24T21:28:07","avatar":""},{"id":"comment-9-0-1-8","author":"Alyssa Marie Donayre","text":"@Clifford Nick Briones  please watch this video tutorial, and update here once done.","timestamp":"2025-10-29T15:21:58","avatar":""},{"id":"comment-9-0-1-9","author":"Clifford Nick Briones","text":"Hello @Alyssa Marie Donayre , I am done watching the tutorial.","timestamp":"2025-10-29T15:46:42","avatar":""}]},{"id":"task-9-0-2","title":"How to arrange keyword research file","status":"status-8","priority":"priority-4","dueDate":"2025-09-05","assignedTo":["a1e57188-a322-42b2-9d33-b5df08033685","cede181a-edf9-40fa-b917-e208ea15d450","cede181a-edf9-40fa-b917-e208ea15d450"],"worksheet":"","clientSheet":"","comments":[{"id":"comment-9-0-2-0","author":"Khedive Adana","text":"Done watching the video tutorial on how to arrange the keywords research file. Thank you for the valuable guidance @Janin Canonero","timestamp":"2025-09-04T20:13:54","avatar":""},{"id":"comment-9-0-2-1","author":"Alyssa Marie Donayre","text":"Currently watching the video. @Dee Tan , also watch this since your task today is keyword research.","timestamp":"2025-09-05T12:01:55","avatar":""},{"id":"comment-9-0-2-2","author":"Dee Tan","text":"Done watching the tutorial . thank you @Janin Canonero .","timestamp":"2025-09-05T12:54:57","avatar":""},{"id":"comment-9-0-2-3","author":"Janin Canonero","text":"@Marie Angela please watch this and post update once done. thanks","timestamp":"2025-09-05T19:12:33","avatar":""},{"id":"comment-9-0-2-4","author":"Marie Angela","text":"Completed watching the video on arranging the keyword research file. thank you for the guidance, it helps doing this task more effectively.","timestamp":"2025-09-08T10:32:27","avatar":""},{"id":"comment-9-0-2-5","author":"Janin Canonero","text":"@Everyone on this board again team make sure to turn the texts white. Maintain our branding, guys, don't just hand over the file to the client without checking every tab and making sure that it's on our standards, whether it's task wise or just a file presentation.    correct way:","timestamp":"2025-09-11T19:29:48","avatar":""},{"id":"comment-9-0-2-6","author":"Alyssa Marie Donayre","text":"this is noted, thank you for reminding us.","timestamp":"2025-09-11T20:59:52","avatar":""},{"id":"comment-9-0-2-7","author":"Alyssa Marie Donayre","text":"this as well @farhan nazardin","timestamp":"2025-09-24T17:29:06","avatar":""},{"id":"comment-9-0-2-8","author":"farhan nazardin","text":"Done, thanks!","timestamp":"2025-09-24T21:21:10","avatar":""},{"id":"comment-9-0-2-9","author":"Alyssa Marie Donayre","text":"thanks, far!","timestamp":"2025-09-24T21:28:19","avatar":""}]}]},{"id":"group-9-1","title":"On-page videos","color":"#4ECDC4","tasks":[{"id":"task-9-1-0","title":"What do H1 mean?","status":"status-2","priority":"","dueDate":"2025-11-20","assignedTo":["f9f11222-d2a9-4ae8-a327-8c4621d90b7c","a1e57188-a322-42b2-9d33-b5df08033685"],"worksheet":"","clientSheet":"","comments":[{"id":"comment-9-1-0-0","author":"Ben Lowe","text":"https://www.loom.com/share/b404190d6885462a8288391c0f037f9c?sid=036c19f1-e20f-4e97-b89c-7765192f2c59","timestamp":"2024-08-27T15:03:23","avatar":""}]}]},{"id":"group-9-2","title":"Google Search Console","color":"#45B7D1","tasks":[{"id":"task-9-2-0","title":"GSC Coverage","status":"status-2","priority":"","dueDate":"2025-11-20","assignedTo":["f9f11222-d2a9-4ae8-a327-8c4621d90b7c","a1e57188-a322-42b2-9d33-b5df08033685"],"worksheet":"","clientSheet":"","comments":[{"id":"comment-9-2-0-0","author":"Ben Lowe","text":"GSC Coverage Issue Part 1GSC Coverage Issue Part 2","timestamp":"2024-08-15T13:25:53","avatar":""}]}]},{"id":"group-9-3","title":"Monday update style","color":"#FFA07A","tasks":[{"id":"task-9-3-0","title":"Meta titles and description format","status":"","priority":"","dueDate":"2025-11-20","assignedTo":null,"worksheet":"","clientSheet":"","comments":[{"id":"comment-9-3-0-0","author":"Janin Canonero","text":"Meta Titles & Descriptions Task Flow:  Assignee:  MUST COMPLETE THESE PARTS BEFORE CONTENT AUDIT  Echo Generation  ○ No duplicate URLs before generation  > ○ Generate all meta titles and descriptions from Echo export.  Transferred to  >  ○ Worksheet  ○ Client File  Fixed File (Google Sheet)  > ○ Worksheet file name Ex: Worksheet: [Business name]  > ○ No extra cells or columns.  > ○ Orange header with white text.  > ○ Neat and properly aligned formatting.  > ● Column headers: Page URL, Meta Title, Meta Description, Character Count (Title), Character Count (Description), Status. ○ Client file name (Client file: [Business name])  > ○ No extra cells or columns.  > ○ Orange header with white text.  > ○ Neat and properly aligned formatting.  > ○ Column headers: Page URL, Meta Title, Meta Description, Character Count (Title), Character Count (Description), Status.  File Attachment:  >  ○ Worksheet attached on Monday  ○ Client File attached on Monday  CAN PROCEED TO THIS ONCE TOP SECTION IS DONE  Quality Audit  >* Complete: ○ Meta Title: 40–55 characters.  ○ Meta Description: 140–155 characters.  ○ Ensure phrasing is keyword-optimised and natural  ○ Branding (Business name) included for product/service pages  ○ Blog URLs (Title topic-focused instead of branding-focused)  ○ No Duplicates  ○ Webpage Content accurate  ○ Formatting issues (business name inclusions and Spellings (British or American) ○ Must be linked to the Management Sheet  > ○ For client file: Should only be the past & current month of work that should be present on the file. (IMPORTANT)  ○ File reviewed, formatted, and approved for upload.  >* Ongoing Fix: ○ Fixing character count  ○ Checking for duplicate content  ○ Checking for content alignment  ○ Putting the branding name for the service/product page  ○ Checking blog URL title/description relevance  Additional Updates:","timestamp":"2025-11-06T15:44:11","avatar":""}]},{"id":"task-9-3-1","title":"Cluster Article Format","status":"","priority":"","dueDate":"2025-11-20","assignedTo":null,"worksheet":"","clientSheet":"","comments":[{"id":"comment-9-3-1-0","author":"Janin Canonero","text":"CLUSTER ARTICLES WORKFLOW:  Assignee:  Monday task name:  > ● Cluster – [number of articles per month] article generation [Month]  EX: Cluster – 50 article generation (Nov)  1. BEFORE YOU START CONTENT AUDIT (Must clear these)  Title topic Generation (Must meet these requirements)  >  ● Informational  ● Educational  ● Commercial  ● Transactional  ● Seasonal (Depends)  ● Target’s client’s market location  Echo Generation  > ● Generate articles from Echo export.  Transferred to  >  ● Worksheet  ● Client File  Fixed File (Google Sheet)  > ○ Worksheet file name (Worksheet: [Business name])  > ○ No extra cells or columns.  > ○ Orange header with white text.  > ○ Neat and properly aligned formatting.  ○ Set up the tab name as Cluster article batch [number] [month]  > ○ Column headers: Title topics and category included, Keyword 1 & 2 and Links  ○ Client file name (Client file: [Business name])  > ○ No extra cells or columns.  > ○ Orange header with white text.  > ○ Neat and properly aligned formatting.  ○ Column headers: Title topics and category included, Keyword 1 & 2 and Links  ○ Set up the tab name as Cluster article batch [number] [month]  > ○ Keywords 1 and 2 are present in the file  ○ NO keyword repeats across the sheet  File Attachment:  >  ● Worksheet attached on Monday  ● Client File attached on Monday  2. COMMON MISTAKES WHEN AUDITING (review these before doing content audit)  Article Standards  > ○ Articles have proper keyword distribution, from title (high relevance to title and article data)  ○ Primary Keyword from title (high relevance to title and article data) - 3-5x in body only (metadata separate: 1-2x)  > ○ Secondary Keywords (topically relevant from article) - 2-4x each in body only  > ○ Distribute keywords: intro, body, H3s, conclusion  ○ Ensure phrasing is natural and keyword-optimised  ○ The article should align with the client's core service functions and also be topic-focused ○ AI text construction should be below 40%  Internal Linking Strategy Standards  > ● Vary position across cluster articles  ● Homepage (Note: Must be on Business name) entry points (Linked: 1-3x only)  ● Contact page in the CONCLUSION section (Linked: 1x only)  ● No “Page” word on interlinks  ● Vary service page distribution  ● Vary anchor text (no repeats across cluster)  ● No service URL Linked more than 1-2x per article  ● No link positions/location across articles  ● Natural interlinking (No forced interlink)  3. QUALITY AUDIT STATUS  Technical Formatting  Outline:  > ○ Title must have the word \"Outline\", Ex: Outline: Cluster Article Workflow  > ○ Proper heading structure (Title H1, Main headings H2, Subheadings H3s)  ○ Clean formatting alignment  ○ Proper metadata setup  Article:  > ○ Proper heading structure (Title H1, Main headings H2, Subheadings H3s)  ○ Clean formatting alignment  ○ Proper metadata setup  For Complete Status (Must meet these):  > ○ No duplicate keywords Google sheet  ○ No repeated linking patterns  ○ No service URL duplicates more than 2x within an article  ○ Word counts and formatting correct (2K – 3K words)  ○ Content alignment verified  ○ No AI generic texts (Refer to QA prompt Guidelines)  ○ Outlines are present ○ Must be linked to the Management sheet ○ FOR CLIENT FILE: Should only be the past & current month of work that should be present in the file. (IMPORTANT)  Ongoing:  >  ○ Fixing AI generic texts  ○ Keyword distribution  ○ Keyword enforcement  ○ Interlinking Issues  ○ HTML code issues with interlinks  ○ Headings Formatting Issues  Additional Updates:","timestamp":"2025-11-06T17:16:55","avatar":""}]},{"id":"task-9-3-2","title":"Keyword Research update format","status":"","priority":"","dueDate":"2025-11-20","assignedTo":null,"worksheet":"","clientSheet":"","comments":[]}]},{"id":"group-9-4","title":"Planning and Research videos","color":"#98D8C8","tasks":[{"id":"task-9-4-0","title":"Competitor Mapping","status":"status-2","priority":"","dueDate":"2025-11-20","assignedTo":"f9f11222-d2a9-4ae8-a327-8c4621d90b7c","worksheet":"","clientSheet":"","comments":[]}]},{"id":"group-9-5","title":"New Group","color":"#FF8B94","tasks":[{"id":"task-9-5-0","title":"What is SEO \\","status":"","priority":"","dueDate":"2025-11-20","assignedTo":null,"worksheet":"","clientSheet":"","comments":[]}]},{"id":"group-9-6","title":"Need Video Tutorials Tasks","color":"#FF6B6B","tasks":[{"id":"task-9-6-0","title":"competitor mapping","status":"","priority":"","dueDate":"2025-11-20","assignedTo":["f9f11222-d2a9-4ae8-a327-8c4621d90b7c","a1e57188-a322-42b2-9d33-b5df08033685"],"worksheet":"","clientSheet":"","comments