ck template being the obvious one). * Page quality / current performance. What can we improve? E.g. the module at the bottom of the pitch deck page is related content, but could be more specific to pitching. * Supporting content / internal links. See what Ben can find and recommendations. * New content. Some good ideas. Commercial impact is one for us to consider... is it better to prioritise pitching or formations, for example, all things being equal?","timestamp":"2025-07-25T12:40:25","avatar":""}]},{"id":"task-20-3-4","title":"URL Details","status":"status-8","priority":"priority-4","dueDate":"2025-05-21","assignedTo":["a1e57188-a322-42b2-9d33-b5df08033685","f9f11222-d2a9-4ae8-a327-8c4621d90b7c"],"worksheet":"","clientSheet":"","comments":[]},{"id":"task-20-3-5","title":"Dev Issues (Individual Pages)","status":"status-8","priority":"priority-4","dueDate":"2025-05-21","assignedTo":["a1e57188-a322-42b2-9d33-b5df08033685","f9f11222-d2a9-4ae8-a327-8c4621d90b7c"],"worksheet":"","clientSheet":"","comments":[]},{"id":"task-20-3-6","title":"Internal Linking","status":"status-8","priority":"priority-4","dueDate":"2025-11-20","assignedTo":["a1e57188-a322-42b2-9d33-b5df08033685","f9f11222-d2a9-4ae8-a327-8c4621d90b7c"],"worksheet":"","clientSheet":"","comments":[]},{"id":"task-20-3-7","title":"SEO Roadmap","status":"status-8","priority":"priority-4","dueDate":"2025-05-21","assignedTo":["a1e57188-a322-42b2-9d33-b5df08033685","f9f11222-d2a9-4ae8-a327-8c4621d90b7c"],"worksheet":"","clientSheet":"","comments":[]},{"id":"task-20-3-8","title":"Alt Texts","status":"status-8","priority":"priority-4","dueDate":"2025-11-20","assignedTo":["a1e57188-a322-42b2-9d33-b5df08033685","f9f11222-d2a9-4ae8-a327-8c4621d90b7c","cede181a-edf9-40fa-b917-e208ea15d450"],"worksheet":"","clientSheet":"","comments":[{"id":"comment-20-3-8-0","author":"Ben Lowe","text":"https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1iSKGXQLgMBhXtm64qjMtUVqWTl7_PyqAZd2UIw6xJnE/edit?gid=0#gid=0   Already done","timestamp":"2025-05-