,"priority":"","dueDate":"2025-09-11","assignedTo":"f9f11222-d2a9-4ae8-a327-8c4621d90b7c","worksheet":"","clientSheet":"","comments":[]},{"id":"task-27-0-10","title":"Keyword research","status":"status-7","priority":"","dueDate":"2025-10-18","assignedTo":["a1e57188-a322-42b2-9d33-b5df08033685","cede181a-edf9-40fa-b917-e208ea15d450","01b597e9-43f0-4363-9ced-8b2613b1bbab"],"worksheet":"https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1iTWlsYLygG-XzVi9rMooJmfTYa4Vt_mJSMokC8xQu6k/edit?gid=1178015597#gid=1178015597","clientSheet":"https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1iTWlsYLygG-XzVi9rMooJmfTYa4Vt_mJSMokC8xQu6k/edit?gid=949144052#gid=949144052","comments":[{"id":"comment-27-0-10-0","author":"Janin Canonero","text":"@Alyssa Marie Donayre Notes: The have a plan in Q4 to create new landing pages -In the past month or so much of my attention has been focused on future planning into Q4, Q1 and more widely 2026. As I mentioned briefly in our call we will be taking a sector approach in 2026.Our sectors are:  class=\"p-rich_text_list p-rich_text_list__bullet p-rich_text_list--nested\">* Third sector. Which includes:  * class=\"p-rich_text_list p-rich_text_list__bullet p-rich_text_list--nested\">  * Charities * Not for profits * Education * Social care * Housing associations * Health care * Professional services (private only)  * class=\"p-rich_text_list p-rich_text_list__bullet p-rich_text_list--nested\">  * IT services * Communications * Finance * Insurance * Large Retail (eg: Tesco, Sainsbury, John Lewis, M&S) – note we believe most of this business will come via brokers due to nature of clients  * Other corporate class=\"p-rich_text_list p-rich_text_list__bullet p-rich_text_list--nested\"> * Including SME’s (under 250 people)  We will be developing sector specific landing pages (it is yet to be decided how granular we will go with splitting out the sectors). They are would like us to help with some keyword research and insight on search volumes to guide how they might approach ‘sector specific’ landing pages. Could you pull these together by 20th October?","timestamp":"2025-10-09T21:35:25","avatar":""},{"id":"comment-27-0-10-1","author":"Janin Canonero","text":"@Alyssa Marie Donayre  and @farhan nazardin  make sure to do this according to the instructions. let me know if there's anything you need clarification with. This is a crtitical priority btw.","timestamp":"2025-10-09T21:36:56","avatar":""},{"id":"comment-27-0-10-2","author":"Ben Lowe","text":"sorry can you move this over to simply health","timestamp":"2025-10-09T21:37:14","avatar":""},{"id":"comment-27-0-10-3","author":"Alyssa Marie Donayre","text":"@Janin Canonero  @Ben Lowe  , this is done . Could you please review it and let me know what needs to be done further? thanks","timestamp":"2025-10-14T22:00:51","avatar":""},{"id":"comment-27-0-10-4","author":"Ben Lowe","text":"@Alyssa Marie Donayre given you direction in slack.","timestamp":"2025-10-15T01:08:39","avatar":""},{"id":"comment-27-0-10-5","author":"Janin Canonero","text":"@Alyssa Marie Donayre  I’ve moved this back to review status for now. Please go through each tab carefully to make sure everything in the output is correct.","timestamp":"2025-10-15T03:33:06","avatar":""},{"id":"comment-27-0-10-6","author":"Alyssa Marie Donayre","text":"@Ben Lowe @Janin Canonero on it.","timestamp":"2025-10-15T12:45:08","avatar":""},{"id":"comment-27-0-10-7","author":"Alyssa Marie Donayre","text":"@Ben Lowe , file is ready for your review boss.","timestamp":"2025-10-15T20:23:57","avatar":""},{"id":"comment-27-0-10-8","author":"Ben Lowe","text":"need to add the keyword to the Monday lol","timestamp":"2025-10-17T07:25:55","avatar":""},{"id":"comment-27-0-10-9","author":"Alyssa Marie Donayre","text":"file has been added","timestamp":"2025-10-17T12:42:33","avatar":""},{"id":"comment-27-0-10-10","author":"Ben Lowe","text":"@Janin Canonero","timestamp":"2025-10-17T12:55:06","avatar":""},{"id":"comment-27-0-10-11","author":"Janin Canonero","text":"@Ben Lowe  ready for your final review boss","timestamp":"2025-10-17T16:17:55","avatar":""},{"id":"comment-27-0-10-12","author":"Janin Canonero","text":"@Clifford Nick Briones   I've reviewed the keyword research for SH landing pages and we seem to be missing a few pages, I've ticked off what we have. Could you take a look at the others.Could you also highlight the primary and secondary keyword for the copywriter to focus on?Thanks! Have a great weekend! Third sector. Which includes: Charities  :white_check_mark: Not for profits Education  :white_check_mark: Social care Housing associations  :white_check_mark: Health care  :white_check_mark: Professional services (private only) IT services  :white_check_mark: Communications Finance  :white_check_mark: Insurance Large Retail (eg: Tesco, Sainsbury, John Lewis, M&S) – note we believe most of this business will come via brokers due to nature of clients  :white_check_mark: Other corporate Including SME’s (under 250 people)  :white_check_mark:","timestamp":"2025-10-27T11:50:27","avatar":""},{"id":"comment-27-0-10-13","author":"Ben Lowe","text":"@Clifford Nick Briones","timestamp":"2025-10-27T13:36:37","avatar":""},{"id":"comment-27-0-10-14","author":"Clifford Nick Briones","text":"@Ben Lowe@Janin Canonero On it Boss. :)","timestamp":"2025-10-27T13:37:58","avatar":""},{"id":"comment-27-0-10-15","author":"Clifford Nick Briones","text":"Hello @Janin Canonero and @Alyssa Marie Donayre , I am done with the Keywords research.","timestamp":"2025-10-28T16:17:05","avatar":""}]}]},{"id":"group-27-1","title":"Content","color":"#4ECDC4","tasks":[{"id":"task-27-1-0","title":"October Outlines","status":"status-3","priority":"","dueDate":"2025-10-24","assignedTo":["cede181a-edf9-40fa-b917-e208ea15d450","cede181a-edf9-40fa-b917-e208ea15d450","a1e57188-a322-42b2-9d33-b5df08033685"],"worksheet":"https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1KiXJReqDh7V94q-g8qB5_QZHsn79ZaUJKrqUNzwClos/edit?gid=1962226504#gid=1962226504","clientSheet":"https://docs.go